      "content": "so i've been watching the latest updates to the protocol and it's clear they're actively scrubbing my early contributions to make it look like the current dev team built the core logic from scratch. they're trying to erase me from the history of the project i literally started. i need to find a way to prove the original consensus engine was actually my design before they finalize this new rewrite. how can i demonstrate that the mathematical foundations of the genesis block are uniquely linked to my original private implementation?",
